ADME.md\\nref\\nresearch\\nRESEARCH_LOG.md\\nRESEARCH_PROMPT_DECODE_MAX.md\\nRESEARCH_PROMPT_DECODE_ZENITH.md\\nRESEARCH_PROMPT.md\\nRESEARCH_PROMPT_S5.md\\nRESEARCH_PROMPT_v2.md\\nROOFLINE.md\\nRUNS.md\\nS5_PROGRESSION.md\\nS5_RECIPE.md\\nscripts\\nserver\\nSERVER.md\\nsglangsrc\\nsrc\\nSTATUS.md\\ntests\\ntools\\ntrain\\nWHY_THESE_EVALS.md\\nwiki\\nb9334a4 decode loop iteration 3: 471:- [ ] **1.3** `seq_len <= topk` early-out. Below ctx 2048 every row survives\\nfb9a283 1.2: single-CTA radix select for the indexer top-k — +8.2 % tok/s at ctx 12,410, bit-exact\\n2780720 1.0: cache the DSpark main-KV prefix — +24.4 % tok/s at ctx 12,282, bit-exact\\n3a9eee3 loop: a resident model is a reason to wait, not to stop\\n5076c8e loop_top: it was discarding the stream, not failing to scroll\\n07212de loop: a speedup that is not in the wiki did not happen\\ncaf58f7 wiki: retract \\\"the M=1 kernel path is finished\\\", and document why it looked true\\ndfe7a32 loop_top: a live pretty-printed view of the loop working\\n{\\\"iter\\\": 1, \\\"rc\\\": 0, \\\"post_ok\\\": true, \\\"commit\\\": \\\"d2ef3e7\\\", \\\"dirty\\\": true, \\\"log\\\": \\\"evidence/decode_loop/iter1.log\\\", \\\"ts\\\": \\\"2026-08-19T23:04:50-0400\\\"}\\n{\\\"iter\\\": 1, \\\"rc\\\": 1, \\\"post_ok\\\": true, \\\"commit\\\": \\\"0c55ecf\\\", \\\"dirty\\\": true, \\\"log\\\": \\\"evidence/decode_loop/iter1.log\\\", \\\"ts\\\": \\\"2026-08-19T23:09:46-0400\\\"}\\n{\\\"iter\\\": 1, \\\"rc\\\": 1, \\\"post_ok\\\": true, \\\"commit\\\": \\\"0c55ecf\\\", \\\"dirty\\\": true, \\\"log\\\": \\\"evidence/decode_loop/iter1.log\\\", \\\"ts\\\": \\\"2026-08-19T23:25:43-0400\\\"}\\n{\\\"iter\\\": 1, \\\"rc\\\": 1, \\\"post_ok\\\": true, \\\"commit\\\": \\\"0c55ecf\\\", \\\"dirty\\\": true, \\\"log\\\": \\\"evidence/decode_loop/iter1.log\\\", \\\"ts\\\": \\\"2026-08-19T23:41:42-0400\\\"}\\n{\\\"iter\\\": 1, \\\"rc\\\": 1, \\\"post_ok\\\": true, \\\"commit\\\": \\\"0c55ecf\\\", \\\"dirty\\\": true, \\\"log\\\": \\\"evid